        <mxCell id="source_e01" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Helvetica;font-size:9.5px;line-height:122%;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#124b8e;&quot;&gt;E01 · UID 17ad7f3baff7 · report 9371013 · OPEN · A1 · support/direct/.9 · score 8.8219&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;They have it set so that the winner take everything , because they want to make sure that I didnt get anything . Did Bush and Rubio set the Florida primary for winner-take-all because they want to prevent Trump from get any delegate ? . Republican official do hope a winner-take-all primary would benefit Bush or Rubio , but Trump get some of his key fact wrong .&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=5;strokeWidth=0.5;strokeColor=#c7dbba;fillColor=#ffffff;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="s1">
