        <mxCell id="source_e03" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Helvetica;font-size:9.5px;line-height:122%;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#124b8e;&quot;&gt;E03 · UID 7498b55efc14 · report 9371013 · OPEN · A2 · refute/direct/.9 · score 6.5988&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Donald Trump wrongly blame Marco Rubio and Jeb Bush for Florida 's winner-take-all primary . attorney have ask Justice Department to investigate Carnival cruise to Cuba » Donald Trump wrongly blame Marco Rubio and Jeb Bush for Florida 's winner-take-all primary Donald Trump have be on a tear accuse the Republican establishment of rig the system to hurt him , despite the fact that he lead the delegate count in the primary . One of the state where leader be out to get him be Florida , he say .&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=5;strokeWidth=0.5;strokeColor=#efb6b7;fillColor=#ffffff;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="s1">
