        <mxCell id="source_e08" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Helvetica;font-size:9.5px;line-height:122%;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#124b8e;&quot;&gt;E08 · UID 039ab597a480 · report 7521067 · CORROBORATE · A1 · support/partial/.6 · score 3.2164&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Jeb Bush say Monday he intend to still be campaign when his home state hold election next month . `` I 'm totally confident I 'll be campaign in Florida , and I 'm confident I 'll do really well there with the best organization , `` Bush say in an interview on CNBC 's `` Squawk on the Street . Florida hold it primary on March 15 and be one of a handful of winner-take-all primary , which award all the state 's delegate to the first-place finisher . It 's that I 'm a leader , `` Bush say .&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=5;strokeWidth=0.5;strokeColor=#c7dbba;fillColor=#ffffff;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="s1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="662" width="787" height="120" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="source_e06" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Helvetica;font-size:9.5px;line-height:122%;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#124b8e;&quot;&gt;E06 · UID b41394f675d8 · report 8355161 · BRIDGE · A1 · background/context/.5 · score 3.0330&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;If Rubio be to have any chance at all , George , he absolutely must win that winner-take-all Florida primary .&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=5;strokeWidth=0.5;strokeColor=#bdd7ef;fillColor=#ffffff;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="s1">
