        <mxCell id="source_e04" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Helvetica;font-size:9.5px;line-height:122%;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;E04 · step/rank 6 · Vox · FALLBACK · irrelevant · score .8879 · topic-only&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;It 's be clear since Rubio declare his candidacy that if he want to win the nomination , he would have to take down Jeb Bush . Rubio be a good campaigner , while Bush 's supporter be get cold foot Marco Rubio be an incredible political talent .&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=5;strokeWidth=0.5;dashed=1;strokeColor=#aaaeb1;fillColor=#fcfcfc;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="s1">
