        <mxCell id="source_e07" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Helvetica;font-size:9.5px;line-height:122%;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;E07 · step/rank 16 · Tampa Bay · FALLBACK · irrelevant · score −.1220 · lexical near-match&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Contrary to the old conventional wisdom , Rubio do get into the race and another giant force emerge to threaten everybody 's plan . His name be Donald Trump , and Navarro acknowledge her fear that Trump could win Florida 's primary . Rubio and Bush may well cannibalize one another 's vote , she say , leave Trump to scoop up a win plurality of antiestablishment vote .&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=5;strokeWidth=0.5;dashed=1;strokeColor=#aaaeb1;fillColor=#fcfcfc;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="s1">
