        <mxCell id="source_e12" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Helvetica;font-size:9.5px;line-height:122%;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;E12 · step/rank 18 · Wikipedia · FALLBACK · irrelevant · score −.1890 · outcome-only&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rubio unsuccessfully seek the Republican nomination for president of the United States in 2016 , win presidential primary in Minnesota , the District of Columbia , and Puerto Rico . He suspend his campaign for president on March 15 , 2016 , after lose the Florida Republican primary to the eventual winner of the presidential election , Donald Trump . During the 2016 Republican presidential primary campaign in which Rubio and Trump be opponent , Rubio be critical of Trump .&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=5;strokeWidth=0.5;dashed=1;strokeColor=#aaaeb1;fillColor=#fcfcfc;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="s1">
